    <solution><p><ol label="a.">
<li>
<p>Solution:</p>
<p><m>\begin{aligned}[t] 
              - \lvert 5-8 \rvert  \amp  = - \lvert -3 \rvert \\
                                         \amp  = {-3} 
          \end{aligned}</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Solution:</p>
<p><m>\begin{aligned}[t] 
               \lvert -5-8 \rvert  \amp  = \lvert -13 \rvert \\
                                         \amp = {13} 
          \end{aligned}</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Solution:</p>
<p><m>\begin{aligned}[t]
              -4 \lvert 8-5 \rvert \amp  = -4 \cdot \lvert 3 \rvert \\
                                          \amp  = -4 \cdot 3 \\
                                          \amp  = {-12} 
         \end{aligned}</m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</solution>
